{"unit_id":"c-ling__dsh-plugin-notify#card-zh","repo":"c-ling/dsh-plugin-notify","commit":"69cf298af2e241a9d83b3320214c413c0dc946cd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-notify 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的消息提醒插件。它监听会话回合结束、执行等待审批和交互提问事件，并通过宿主接口与客户端展示通知。主要能力包括页面横幅、桌面或浏览器通知、宿主系统通知，以及飞书、钉钉、企业微信和通用 Webhook；设置页可配置触发条件、渠道和模板。适合希望及时获知 DSH 任务状态的用户；外部渠道需自行配置对应通知地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:657-684","lib/index.js:995-1001","lib/client.js:1765-1785"]}
{"unit_id":"c-ling__dsh-plugin-notify#card-en","repo":"c-ling/dsh-plugin-notify","commit":"69cf298af2e241a9d83b3320214c413c0dc946cd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-notify alerts DSH Web and Desktop users when turns finish, approval is needed, or a question awaits. It provides in-page, system, browser, and desktop notifications plus Feishu, DingTalk, WeCom, and generic webhooks. Configure triggers, channels, and templates in its settings page.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:657-684","lib/index.js:995-1001","lib/client.js:1765-1785"]}
